  reason: "The required floor's stale-match planning (gunbc#11194) needs the base revision's declaration index reconstructed from the head index with the diff applied in reverse, read under the base's own parse environment; joint_claim_join needs base-side records and the diff's two sides for its own join; behavioral_receipt_host needs one checked git invocation. None of that is the deleted wall's adjudication: no delta is computed here and no verdict is issued. WHY RUST RATHER THAN .dag: the input carrier is the host-only ModuleDeclarationRecord (gunbc.declaration_index_seed_growth CLASS A) and the acquisition is git over the object store, the scm lane's CLASS B boundary. The change is a RENAME of already-admitted items off a deleted module: every declaration below existed in namespace_wave_admission.rs on main, admitted under the wall's own justification, and moves unchanged except that the gate-only items are gone with that file.",
